User-visible name only: page title and application name, logo
wordmark (WY white + 赛车 volt, same sizes and classes, so layout
is unchanged except the wordmark is narrower), loading-screen and
pause-menu footers, and the multiplayer share title. Internal code
names, storage keys, driver-key file, domains and Pages project are
unchanged, so settings, leaderboard keys and URLs keep working.
